  "text": "Recipe: Quinoa Pumpkin Bread\nCreator: Mrs N K Manku\nCategory: Bread\nIngredients: sprouted quinoa flour, grated pumpkin, cinnamon powder, garlic powder, ground chia seeds, flaxseed powder\nCooking methods: no-cook, air-fry, bake\nInstructions: 1) Mix all the ingredients & make a firm dough. Add a few drops of water or some more flour if needed.\n2) Transfer the dough to a baking container lined with parchment paper. Allow it to rest for 10 minutes. Sprinkle some seeds on top.\n3) Bake in an air fryer at 180 C for 30 to 35 minutes.\nNotes: SOS-Free. Without a raising agent. A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (sprouted quinoa flour), RAINBOW VEGGIES (pumpkin), NUTS & SEEDS (ground chia seeds, flaxseed powder), HERBS & SPICES (cinnamon powder, garlic powder).",
